# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets and local state out of
# it. Anything listed here cannot end up in an image layer by accident.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

.git/
.github/
.claude/

tests/
docs/
deploy/
README.md

**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.DS_Store

# Credentials and local overrides. .env in particular holds the GitHub Packages token —
# keeping it out of the context matters because the Dockerfile now takes that token as a
# build arg, so nothing here should also ship it as a file.
.env
**/.env
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json

Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
